# Spock, Always Your Friend: "You may reveal a noncreature, nonland card from among them and put it into your hand"
# (CR 701.20) - the look is the instruction and the taking only its option, so Bot1 may take nothing even with a Lightning
# Bolt among the four; all four go to the bottom in its chosen order and the hand is unchanged.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Spock, Always Your Friend
Island
Island
Island
Island
Grizzly Bears
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spock, Always Your Friend.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Grizzly Bears; Lightning Bolt; Forest; Mountain)
